        id: "int-sci-2-s2t1-intro",
        type: "info",
        content: "**Human Excretory Organs**\\n\\nWelcome to Section 2! Our bodies produce various waste products as a result of metabolic processes. These waste products must be removed to maintain a healthy internal environment. The process of removing metabolic waste from the body is called **excretion**.\\n\\nSeveral organs in the body work together to carry out excretion. In this lesson, we will explore the structure and function of the main excretory organs in the human body.",
