        content: "**Effect of Smoke and Common Respiratory Disorders**\\n\\nThe respiratory system is constantly exposed to the external environment, making it vulnerable to damage from pollutants, smoke, and pathogens. In this lesson, we will explore how smoke affects the respiratory system and learn about common respiratory disorders.\\n\\nUnderstanding these conditions can help us make informed decisions about our health and lifestyle.",
