        content: "✅ **Key Takeaways: Building a Simple Phone Charger**\\n\\nIn this lesson, you learned about:\\n• The key components of a phone charger (transformer, rectifier, capacitor, regulator)\\n• How AC power is converted to DC power for charging\\n• The function of each component in the charging process\\n• Safety considerations when working with electronics\\n\\nUnderstanding how everyday devices work helps us appreciate the practical applications of electronics in our lives.",
